                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16759914" author="dpavlov" created="Mon, 4 Feb 2019 15:09:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC with fix was started: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=2996903&amp;amp;tab=queuedBuildOverviewTab&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=ignite-11155&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=2996903&amp;amp;tab=queuedBuildOverviewTab&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=ignite-11155&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16760711" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 5 Feb 2019 11:37:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This fix affected 4 suites. The new exception is compilation error (related to tools/change of API for Java Doclets).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=ignite.git;a=commit;h=8cba313c9961b16e358834216e9992310f285985&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=ignite.git;a=commit;h=8cba313c9961b16e358834216e9992310f285985&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vveider&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vveider&quot;&gt;vveider&lt;/a&gt; thank you for finding out a reason. WDYT about reopening this ticket for further research? or do you prefer to create a new one?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16760714" author="vveider" created="Tue, 5 Feb 2019 11:45:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt;, let&apos;s create a new one.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16760742" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 5 Feb 2019 12:26:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fix helped for 4 suites. Resolving issue&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
